{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the DEMO of Dingir OS \u2013 the finest and only operating system that includes everything you need to explore the Deep Web. This demo offers a limited, curated glimpse into the full experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a closed system created by the netstalker group NOOSPHERE, it is now available to you! Inside this preview, you'll find a portion of the engaging programs for surfing the darkest corners of the network, diaries of group members, voice recordings, and digital artifacts collected by netstalkers over many years years years years of research!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please treat the contents of this OS with the utmost seriousness. We cannot guarantee your safety. Everything inside is to be explored at your own peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features in this DEMO:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slice of the short interactive horror story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point-and-click interface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A selection of mini-games!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A taste of the deep lore of netstalker culture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sample multimedia library of terrifying files</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119450?t=1761665811","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119450?t=1761665811","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119450/b78af78c30a06c5458ee84ab45b76e6ae004dfa4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761665811","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119450/b78af78c30a06c5458ee84ab45b76e6ae004dfa4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761665811","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null}